00:02:05.750 --> 00:02:23.564
Malis visits her uncle in the countryside. His wooden farmhouse is at the end of a dirt road. Behind the house, there are green paddy fields and a mango orchard. Children play near the haystack. Uncle gets water from the village well. They cross a bamboo bridge and see an old windmill.

